---
---
<section id="integrations" class="py-24 border-t border-hinoki/15 relative bg-yakisugi-950/30">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-hinoki mb-3 block">Ecosystem</span>
      <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-shikkui tracking-tight mb-4">
        現代の建築道具（主要 Bundlers）と直結
      </h3>
      <p class="text-shikkui-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Vite、Next.js、Metro、Storybook、TanStack Start。どの現場の足場でも、Hozo は設定一行で自然に組み上がります。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Integrations Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Vite -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl timber-panel border border-hinoki/15 hover:border-hinoki/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-shikkui flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-hinoki/15 text-hinoki flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs font-bold border border-hinoki/30">V</span>
              Vite
            </h4>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">@hozo/vite</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs mb-4">
            React プラグインより前に実行され、JSX をセマンティック DOM と CSS へ直截に変換。
          </p>
          <pre class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-yakisugi-950/90 border border-hinoki/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-shikkui-muted overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="text-hinoki">import</span> &#123; hozo &#125; <span class="text-hinoki">from</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'@hozo/vite'</span>

<span class="text-hinoki">export default</span> defineConfig(&#123;
  <span class="text-stone-400">plugins:</span> [
    hozo(&#123; <span class="text-stone-400">css:</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'src/theme.css'</span> &#125;),
    react(),
  ],
&#125;)</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Next.js -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl timber-panel border border-hinoki/15 hover:border-hinoki/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-shikkui flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-shikkui/10 text-shikkui flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs font-bold border border-shikkui/20">N</span>
              Next.js
            </h4>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">@hozo/next</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs mb-4">
            Turbopack（Next.js 16）および Webpack を完全サポート。ゼロコンフィグで動作。
          </p>
          <pre class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-yakisugi-950/90 border border-hinoki/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-shikkui-muted overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="text-hinoki">import</span> &#123; withHozo &#125; <span class="text-hinoki">from</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'@hozo/next'</span>

<span class="text-hinoki">export default</span> withHozo(
  &#123; <span class="text-stone-500">/* next config */</span> &#125;,
  &#123; <span class="text-stone-400">css:</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'src/theme.css'</span> &#125;
)</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Metro (Expo / React Native) -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl timber-panel border border-hinoki/15 hover:border-hinoki/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-shikkui flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-tatami/20 text-tatami-light flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs font-bold border border-tatami/40">M</span>
              Metro / Expo
            </h4>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">@hozo/metro</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs mb-4">
            Native バックエンドによる React Native StyleSheet および Fabric プリミティブへの静的展開。
          </p>
          <pre class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-yakisugi-950/90 border border-hinoki/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-shikkui-muted overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="text-hinoki">const</span> &#123; withHozo &#125; = require(<span class="text-tatami-light">'@hozo/metro/config'</span>)

module.exports = withHozo(
  getDefaultConfig(__dirname),
  &#123; <span class="text-stone-400">css:</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'src/theme.css'</span> &#125;
)</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Storybook -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl timber-panel border border-hinoki/15 hover:border-hinoki/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-shikkui flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-bengara/20 text-bengara flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs font-bold border border-bengara/30">S</span>
              Storybook
            </h4>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">@hozo/storybook</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs mb-4">
            Vite Web バックエンドを基盤としたゼロコンフィグのプリセット。
          </p>
          <pre class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-yakisugi-950/90 border border-hinoki/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-shikkui-muted overflow-x-auto mb-4"><code><span class="text-hinoki">export default</span> &#123;
  <span class="text-stone-400">framework:</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'@storybook/react-vite'</span>,
  <span class="text-stone-400">addons:</span> [<span class="text-tatami-light">'@hozo/storybook'</span>],
&#125;</code></pre>
          <a
            href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/storybook/`}
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-bengara hover:text-bengara-hover transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Storybook を開く</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TanStack Start -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl timber-panel border border-hinoki/15 hover:border-hinoki/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-shikkui flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-hinoki-light/20 text-hinoki-light flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs font-bold border border-hinoki-light/30">T</span>
              TanStack Start
            </h4>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">@hozo/vite</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs mb-4">
            TanStack Start、Nitro、および Hozo Vite コンパイラによるフルスタック SSR。
          </p>
          <pre class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-yakisugi-950/90 border border-hinoki/10 font-mono text-[11px] text-shikkui-muted overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="text-hinoki">export default</span> defineConfig(&#123;
  <span class="text-stone-400">plugins:</span> [
    hozo(&#123; <span class="text-stone-400">css:</span> <span class="text-tatami-light">'src/theme.css'</span> &#125;),
    tanstackStart(),
  ],
&#125;)</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Conformance -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl timber-panel border border-hinoki/15 hover:border-hinoki/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-shikkui flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-tatami/20 text-tatami-light flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs font-bold border border-tatami/40">C</span>
              Conformance
            </h4>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">@hozo/tailwind-conformance</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-stone-400 text-xs mb-4">
            本物の Tailwind エンジンと Hozo の出力を 1:1 で差分検知する自動テストスイート。
          </p>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-yakisugi-950/90 border border-hinoki/10 text-xs text-tatami-light font-mono mb-4">
            &check; CI で継続的に差分スナップショットを検証中
          </div>
          <a
            href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/conformance/`}
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-hinoki hover:text-hinoki-light transition-colors"
          >
            <span>適合性マトリクス (Conformance)</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
